&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;pv&lt;/b&gt; 299 (26d8+182)
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;R&#233;f&lt;/b&gt; +14, &lt;b&gt;Vig&lt;/b&gt; +17, &lt;b&gt;Vol&lt;/b&gt; +20
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Capacit&#233;s d&#233;fensives&lt;/b&gt; &#226;mes encha&#238;n&#233;es, &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;R&#233;sistance-&#192;-La-Canalisation-(Capacit&#233;).html&quot; title=&quot;R&#233;sistance &#224; la canalisation (Ext)&quot;&gt;r&#233;sistance &#224; la canalisation&lt;/a&gt; +4, &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Vision-&#192;-360&#176;-(Capacit&#233;).html&quot; title=&quot;Vision &#224; 360&#176; (Ext)&quot;&gt;vision &#224; 360&#176;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;b&gt;Immunit&#233;s&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Traits-Des-Morts-Vivants-(Capacit&#233;).html&quot; title=&quot;Traits des morts-vivants (Ext)&quot;&gt;traits des morts-vivants&lt;/a&gt; ; &lt;b&gt;RM&lt;/b&gt; 29
